        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electric arc furnace converter</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electric arc furnace converter
Assumptions for medium sized plant. Output: 500'000 t/a, life time: 50 years.;
UUID: a215ee01-c34d-3479-b1bb-c036766ad0a9
Infrastructure for input material unloading and storage, for EAF processes and casting and for administrative buildings
Location: Some Swiss datasets are used for European processes.
Technology: Assumed technology of medium sized plant.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Internet search 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a215ee01-c34d-3479-b1bb-c036766ad0a9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
